 ],
 "what_this_index_does_not_claim": [
  "It does not assign a cause to any failure. §AD2 forbids causes in this material.",
  "It does not claim that a record showing the flake ids on FAILED lines is a record of the §AC4 flake EVENT. vqr3_fullsuite.log shows all TEN methods of the class failing inside a run of 238 failed / 1853 errors with 'FATAL: database test_bbrose_db does not exist'; the flake event was two methods on a 7-failed board. §AG4 states both facts and deliberately does not choose between them.",
  "It does not claim completeness. It covers what was on this disk on 2026-08-20 and nothing about runs whose output was never written to a file."
 ],
